  user_input {
    user_response: "problem statement : Create a GenAI-powered assistant that helps families and communities navigate severe winter smog and urban air pollution. The application should suggest low-emission daily routines, indoor air quality hacks, and sustainable alternatives tailored to their location and lifestyle, while clearly explaining the direct impact of their choices. It should also provide real-time air quality alerts and health-conscious activity recommendations.\nuse meteo ai for precise local weather and pollution forecasting data integration.\nmake a website for this purpose that features a minimalist, responsive dashboard with intuitive data visualization and actionable tips.\nuse ui that don\'t resemble AI generated website\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "problem statement : Create a GenAI-powered assistant that helps families and communities navigate severe winter smog and urban air pollution. The application should suggest low-emission daily routines, indoor air quality hacks, and sustainable alternatives tailored to their location and lifestyle, while clearly explaining the direct impact of their choices. It should also provide real-time air quality alerts and health-conscious activity recommendations.\nuse meteo ai for precise local weather and pollution forecasting data integration.\nmake a website for this purpose that features a minimalist, responsive dashboard with intuitive data visualization and actionable tips.\nuse ui that don\'t resemble AI generated website\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nInstructions: If you need more context from the user you must first ask the user some questions using the ask_question tool. If you ask questions, you must wait for the user\'s answers. After the questions you must present a plan.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
