  user_input {
    user_response: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: Which minimalist visual aesthetic feels most authentic and non-generic for the dashboard?\nA: Nordic Civic Instrument (Warm Stone and Ink)\nQ: We will integrate Open-Meteo real-time weather and air quality APIs. Which default fallback city should load before users search or share location?\nA: Global with auto-detect and city search (Delhi default)\nQ: Which combination of tailored features should we prioritize in the dashboard?\nA: Streamlined daily briefing and safe activity planner\nQ: How should the GenAI guidance appear within the interface?\nA: Structured auto-generated guidance without chat UI\n</clarifying-answers>"
    items {
      text: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: Which minimalist visual aesthetic feels most authentic and non-generic for the dashboard?\nA: Nordic Civic Instrument (Warm Stone and Ink)\nQ: We will integrate Open-Meteo real-time weather and air quality APIs. Which default fallback city should load before users search or share location?\nA: Global with auto-detect and city search (Delhi default)\nQ: Which combination of tailored features should we prioritize in the dashboard?\nA: Streamlined daily briefing and safe activity planner\nQ: How should the GenAI guidance appear within the interface?\nA: Structured auto-generated guidance without chat UI\n</clarifying-answers>"
    }
