    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGoSiEk9WgVdFZXZZFvS6s-H4v7Xs1PxFO-1HN8mdu-JFplro2Q56Ou9sW8yQ_Aa562akPK5t54KsCkW0xYxvGG71nFmp97RA3WfjQJMsvEF2M9mdGNBZ8Bu1YmscIXcmgQbI4="
      title: "open-meteo.com"
    }
    summary: "The endpoint URL and configuration parameters for the Open-Meteo Air Quality API to fetch hourly **US AQI**, **PM2.5**, and **PM10** data are structured as follows:\n\n### **Endpoint URL**\n```http\nhttps://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality\n```[1][2]\n\n---\n\n### **Required & Optional Parameters**\n* **`latitude`**: WGS84 latitude of the location (e.g., `52.52`)[3]\n* **`longitude`**: WGS84 longitude of the location (e.g., `13.41`)[3]\n* **`hourly`**: Comma-separated list of air quality parameters[3]. To request US AQI alongside particulate matter, use:\n  ```text\n  hourly=us_aqi,us_aqi_pm2_5,us_aqi_pm10,pm2_5,pm10\n  ```\n  *(Note: `us_aqi` returns the consolidated overall US AQI[4], while `us_aqi_pm2_5` and `us_aqi_pm10` return the sub-indices for those specific pollutants[4]. `pm2_5` and `pm10` return the raw concentration values in $\\mu\\text{g/m}^3$[1]).*\n\n---\n\n### **Example API Request URL**\nHere is a complete query example for Berlin, Germany:\n\n```http\nhttps://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality?latitude=52.52&longitude=13.41&hourly=us_aqi,us_aqi_pm2_5,us_aqi_pm10,pm2_5,pm10\n```\n\nSources:\n[1] [open-meteo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFIizpGA_CtOWtDO6zl8ObJUVdke-BYsa8suljWwYEKxV2oCqMqI6_Cu6AcN3poJOabgOWZWfH6LSVeCpMwY1ynQuqTZJmrP_ar8gx-C9d4sbIPFL9Y2LCBRA98BpxdCD80bD-e)\n[2] [fibric.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTvXhEVor4rndrviktmV6VW_TfLc69-yBxPn-KvGVbccoBCp3i_U4Knud3FR-eHteIWKylGePBvFcnFLPPyOB1h0FTAHM9pRfTSdQbD5xL7-AYeVJ2fQP62vZpmMkxeKGsoXGjrRnDylwe9uLfNbdHU3V9lg==)\n[3] [sandbase.ai](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEdmCqj602wrAlZV17LVTr7Lgu2xeLqo-HMUqx30preFc2E9fDLZp0mHit8b6ggvMYgl5gUQ3oC89OsApfW0f_jwLzl3WjLh9rUzstDeQ40l-vetuP1_k5l3g3RatQ5nGb_0OXWnEh2aTQ=)\n[4] [open-meteo.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGoSiEk9WgVdFZXZZFvS6s-H4v7Xs1PxFO-1HN8mdu-JFplro2Q56Ou9sW8yQ_Aa562akPK5t54KsCkW0xYxvGG71nFmp97RA3WfjQJMsvEF2M9mdGNBZ8Bu1YmscIXcmgQbI4=)"
