            lines {
              text: "- **Location & Forecast Data (Confirmed)**: Live integration with Open-Meteo\'s Air Quality, Weather Forecast, and Geocoding APIs (no external weather API key needed), supporting browser geolocation auto-detect, global city search, and **New Delhi, India** as the initial default city."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
