    artifact_metadata {
      summary: "Implementation plan for Air Almanac, a minimalist Nordic Civic Instrument dashboard integrating live Open-Meteo air quality/weather forecasting and structured server-side Gemini guidance for navigating severe winter smog and urban air pollution."
