  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Crafting the Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation phase. I\'m focusing on building the modular components and `App.tsx` concurrently. Specifically, I\'m working on the `/src/components/ForecastChart.tsx`, which will be a responsive SVG chart, displaying 48 hours of forecast data. It\'ll use a `cursor-crosshair` for enhanced user interaction. I\'m planning three clear display modes, including `AQI`.\n\n\n**Refining the Chart Features**\n\nI\'m now iterating on the chart\'s detailed display modes, fine-tuning the visual presentation. I\'m focusing on the data representations for AQI, PM2.5, Dust & Gases, and Wind & Humidity, including color choices and line styles. The interactive pointer and keyboard navigation are coming along nicely; the crosshair interaction and tabular inspection readout are almost done.\n\n\n**Developing the Daily Ledger**\n\nI\'m now deeply engaged in the design of the `/src/components/DailyBriefingLedger.tsx` component. I\'m focusing on the structured GenAI briefing and Daily Action Ledger. The goal is a zero-chat UI, presenting information in a clear, tabular format. I\'m prioritizing the display of the active household profile summary, along with buttons for profile adjustments and briefing refreshes. I\'m also working on the \"Daily Impact Ledger Summary Strip\", ensuring the tabular readouts for actions committed, emissions avoided, and exposure drop are both informative and scientifically sound.\n\n\n**Designing the Ledger Filter**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the Daily Action Ledger\'s interactive filter. I\'m building it as a segmented control with categories like \"All,\" \"Low-Emission Routines,\" \"Indoor Air Hacks,\" and \"Sustainable Alternatives.\" Each recommendation will be a flat hairline row with an accessible checkbox toggle for commitment. I\'m focusing on concise titles, metadata, and side-by-side impact lines.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "dLgBa4Ez4bvj4Q_Tkbu5Dg"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_5829391824457035480"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { useMemo, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport type { HourlyPoint } from \'../types/air\';\\n\\ninterface ForecastChartProps {\\n  hourly: HourlyPoint[];\\n  currentTime: string;\\n}\\n\\ntype ChartMode = \'aqi_pm25\' | \'gases\' | \'dispersion\';\\n\\nconst SVG_WIDTH = 960;\\nconst SVG_HEIGHT = 270;\\nconst PAD = { top: 20, right: 20, bottom: 34, left: 46 };\\nconst PLOT_W = SVG_WIDTH - PAD.left - PAD.right;\\nconst PLOT_H = SVG_HEIGHT - PAD.top - PAD.bottom;\\n\\nfunction buildPath(points: Array<{ x: number; y: number }>): string {\\n  if (points.length === 0) return \'\';\\n  return points\\n    .map((pt, i) => `${i === 0 ? \'M\' : \'L\'} ${pt.x.toFixed(1)} ${pt.y.toFixed(1)}`)\\n    .join(\' \');\\n}\\n\\nexport function ForecastChart({ hourly, currentTime }: ForecastChartProps) {\\n  const [mode, setMode] = useState<ChartMode>(\'aqi_pm25\');\\n\\n  const initialIndex = useMemo(() => {\\n    const prefix = currentTime.slice(0, 13);\\n    const found = hourly.findIndex((h) => h.time.startsWith(prefix));\\n    return found >= 0 ? found : 0;\\n  }, [hourly, currentTime]);\\n\\n  const [activeIndex, setActiveIndex] = useState<number>(initialIndex);\\n  const safeIndex = Math.min(Math.max(activeIndex, 0), Math.max(hourly.length - 1, 0));\\n  const selected = hourly[safeIndex];\\n\\n  const dayBoundaryIndex = useMemo(\\n    () => hourly.findIndex((h) => h.dayIndex === 1),\\n    [hourly]\\n  );\\n\\n  const chartData = useMemo(() => {\\n    if (hourly.length === 0) {\\n      return { maxY: 100, ticks: [0, 50, 100], series: [] as Array<{ id: string; label: string; color: string; dashed?: boolean; path: string; points: Array<{ x: number; y: number }> }> };\\n    }\\n\\n    const xFor = (i: number) =>\\n      PAD.left + (hourly.length > 1 ? (i / (hourly.length - 1)) * PLOT_W : 0);\\n\\n    if (mode === \'aqi_pm25\') {\\n      const maxVal = Math.max(\\n        100,\\n        ...hourly.map((h) => Math.max(h.usAqi, h.pm25))\\n      );\\n      const maxY = Math.ceil(maxVal / 50) * 50;\\n      const yFor = (v: number) => PAD.top + PLOT_H - (Math.min(v, maxY) / maxY) * PLOT_H;\\n\\n      const aqiPts = hourly.map((h, i) => ({ x: xFor(i), y: yFor(h.usAqi) }));\\n      const pm25Pts = hourly.map((h, i) => ({ x: xFor(i), y: yFor(h.pm25) }));\\n\\n      return {\\n        maxY,\\n        ticks: [0, Math.round(maxY * 0.25), Math.round(maxY * 0.5), Math.round(maxY * 0.75), maxY],\\n        whoLineY: yFor(15),\\n        series: [\\n          {\\n            id: \'usAqi\',\\n            label: \'US AQI\',\\n            color: \'#181715\',\\n            path: buildPath(aqiPts),\\n            points: aqiPts,\\n          },\\n          {\\n            id: \'pm25\',\\n            label: \'PM2.5 (\302\265g/m\302\263)\',\\n            color: \'#B84A27\',\\n            dashed: true,\\n            path: buildPath(pm25Pts),\\n            points: pm25Pts,\\n          },\\n        ],\\n      };\\n    }\\n\\n    if (mode === \'gases\') {\\n      const maxVal = Math.max(\\n        80,\\n        ...hourly.map((h) => Math.max(h.pm10, h.no2, h.o3))\\n      );\\n      const maxY = Math.ceil(maxVal / 40) * 40;\\n      const yFor = (v: number) => PAD.top + PLOT_H - (Math.min(v, maxY) / maxY) * PLOT_H;\\n\\n      const pm10Pts = hourly.map((h, i) => ({ x: xFor(i), y: yFor(h.pm10) }));\\n      const no2Pts = hourly.map((h, i) => ({ x: xFor(i), y: yFor(h.no2) }));\\n      const o3Pts = hourly.map((h, i) => ({ x: xFor(i), y: yFor(h.o3) }));\\n\\n      return {\\n        maxY,\\n        ticks: [0, Math.round(maxY * 0.25), Math.round(maxY * 0.5), Math.round(maxY * 0.75), maxY],\\n        whoLineY: undefined,\\n        series: [\\n          {\\n            id: \'pm10\',\\n            label: \'PM10 (\302\265g/m\302\263)\',\\n            color: \'#181715\',\\n            path: buildPath(pm10Pts),\\n            points: pm10Pts,\\n          },\\n          {\\n            id: \'no2\',\\n            label: \'NO\342\202\202 (\302\265g/m\302\263)\',\\n            color: \'#1F4E43\',\\n            path: buildPath(no2Pts),\\n            points: no2Pts,\\n          },\\n          {\\n            id: \'o3\',\\n            label: \'O\342\202\203 (\302\265g/m\302\263)\',\\n            color: \'#9A6B16\',\\n            dashed: true,\\n            path: buildPath(o3Pts),\\n            points: o3Pts,\\n          },\\n        ],\\n      };\\n    }\\n\\n    // dispersion mode: wind (scaled visually on 0-100 axis? Better: show Wind km/h & Humidity % clearly on 0-100 scale)\\n    const maxWind = Math.max(25, ...hourly.map((h) => h.windSpeed));\\n    const maxY = Math.max(100, Math.ceil(maxWind / 20) * 20);\\n    const yFor = (v: number) => PAD.top + PLOT_H - (Math.min(v, maxY) / maxY) * PLOT_H;\\n\\n    const humPts = hourly.map((h, i) => ({ x: xFor(i), y: yFor(h.humidity) }));\\n    const windPts = hourly.map((h, i) => ({ x: xFor(i), y: yFor(h.windSpeed) }));\\n\\n    return {\\n      maxY,\\n      ticks: [0, 25, 50, 75, 100],\\n      whoLineY: undefined,\\n      series: [\\n        {\\n          id: \'wind\',\\n          label: \'Wind Speed (km/h)\',\\n          color: \'#1F4E43\',\\n          path: buildPath(windPts),\\n          points: windPts,\\n        },\\n        {\\n          id: \'humidity\',\\n          label: \'Relative Humidity (%)\',\\n          color: \'#847F75\',\\n          dashed: true,\\n          path: buildPath(humPts),\\n          points: humPts,\\n        },\\n      ],\\n    };\\n  }, [hourly, mode]);\\n\\n  const handlePointerMove = (e: React.PointerEvent<SVGSVGElement>) => {\\n    if (hourly.length === 0) return;\\n    const rect = e.currentTarget.getBoundingClientRect();\\n    const relX = ((e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * SVG_WIDTH;\\n    const clamped = Math.min(Math.max(relX - PAD.left, 0), PLOT_W);\\n    const idx = Math.round((clamped / PLOT_W) * (hourly.length - 1));\\n    setActiveIndex(idx);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleKeyDown = (e: React.KeyboardEvent<SVGSVGElement>) => {\\n    if (e.key === \'ArrowRight\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      setActiveIndex((prev) => Math.min(prev + 1, hourly.length - 1));\\n    } else if (e.key === \'ArrowLeft\') {\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      setActiveIndex((prev) => Math.max(prev - 1, 0));\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const xPos = (i: number) =>\\n    PAD.left + (hourly.length > 1 ? (i / (hourly.length - 1)) * PLOT_W : 0);\\n\\n  if (hourly.length === 0) {\\n    return null;\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section\\n      id=\\\"forecast\\\"\\n      className=\\\"scroll-mt-20 rounded-md border border-[#E2DDD3] bg-white p-6\\\"\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-[#EFECE6] pb-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h2 className=\\\"text-lg font-semibold text-[#181715]\\\">\\n            48-Hour Pollution &amp; Dispersion Forecast\\n          </h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"mt-0.5 text-xs text-[#5E5A52]\\\">\\n            Move pointer or use arrow keys across the timeline to inspect exact hourly Open-Meteo readings.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div\\n          role=\\\"tablist\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Forecast metric view\\\"\\n          className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 self-start rounded-md bg-[#EFECE6] p-1\\\"\\n        >\\n          {(\\n            [\\n              { id: \'aqi_pm25\', label: \'AQI & PM2.5\' },\\n              { id: \'gases\', label: \'Dust & Gases\' },\\n              { id: \'dispersion\', label: \'Wind & Humidity\' },\\n            ] as const\\n          ).map((tab) => (\\n            <button\\n              key={tab.id}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              role=\\\"tab\\\"\\n              aria-selected={mode === tab.id}\\n              onClick={() => setMode(tab.id)}\\n              className={`rounded px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer ${\\n                mode === tab.id\\n                  ? \'bg-white text-[#181715] shadow-xs\'\\n                  : \'text-[#5E5A52] hover:text-[#181715]\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {tab.label}\\n            </button>\\n          ))}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Snapped Crosshair Tabular Inspection Bar */}\\n      {selected && (\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[#EFECE6] pb-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#847F75]\\\">Selected Hour</span>\\n              <p className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#181715]\\\">\\n                {selected.dayIndex === 0 ? \'Today\' : \'Tomorrow\'} {selected.hourLabel}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#847F75]\\\">US AQI</span>\\n              <p className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#181715]\\\">\\n                {selected.usAqi}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#847F75]\\\">PM2.5</span>\\n              <p className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-[#B84A27]\\\">\\n                {selected.pm25} \302\265g/m\302\263\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#847F75]\\\">PM10</span>\\n              <p className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-[#181715]\\\">\\n                {selected.pm10} \302\265g/m\302\263\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#847F75]\\\">NO\342\202\202</span>\\n              <p className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-[#1F4E43]\\\">\\n                {selected.no2} \302\265g/m\302\263\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#847F75]\\\">Wind</span>\\n              <p className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-[#181715]\\\">\\n                {selected.windSpeed} km/h\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#847F75]\\\">Temp / RH</span>\\n              <p className=\\\"font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-[#181715]\\\">\\n                {selected.temperature}\302\260C \302\267 {selected.humidity}%\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Inline Series Legend */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs text-[#5E5A52]\\\">\\n            {chartData.series.map((s) => (\\n              <span key={s.id} className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                <svg width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n                  <line\\n                    x1=\\\"0\\\"\\n                    y1=\\\"4\\\"\\n                    x2=\\\"16\\\"\\n                    y2=\\\"4\\\"\\n                    stroke={s.color}\\n                    strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\"\\n                    strokeDasharray={s.dashed ? \'3 2\' : undefined}\\n                  />\\n                </svg>\\n                <span>{s.label}</span>\\n              </span>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Precision SVG Plot */}\\n      <div className=\\\"mt-4 w-full overflow-x-auto\\\">\\n        <svg\\n          viewBox={`0 0 ${SVG_WIDTH} ${SVG_HEIGHT}`}\\n          role=\\\"img\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"48 hour air quality and dispersion line chart\\\"\\n          tabIndex={0}\\n          onPointerMove={handlePointerMove}\\n          onPointerDown={handlePointerMove}\\n          onKeyDown={handleKeyDown}\\n          className=\\\"h-auto w-full min-w-[600px] cursor-crosshair select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#1F4E43]\\\"\\n        >\\n          {/* Horizontal gridlines & Y ticks */}\\n          {chartData.ticks.map((tick) => {\\n            const y = PAD.top + PLOT_H - (tick / chartData.maxY) * PLOT_H;\\n            return (\\n              <g key={tick}>\\n                <line\\n                  x1={PAD.left}\\n                  y1={y}\\n                  x2={SVG_WIDTH - PAD.right}\\n                  y2={y}\\n                  stroke=\\\"#EFECE6\\\"\\n                  strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\"\\n                />\\n                <text\\n                  x={PAD.left - 8}\\n                  y={y + 4}\\n                  textAnchor=\\\"end\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"fill-[#847F75] font-mono text-[10px]\\\"\\n                >\\n                  {tick}\\n                </text>\\n              </g>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n\\n          {/* WHO 15 \302\265g/m\302\263 Reference Line on AQI & PM2.5 view */}\\n          {chartData.whoLineY !== undefined && (\\n            <g>\\n              <line\\n                x1={PAD.left}\\n                y1={chartData.whoLineY}\\n                x2={SVG_WIDTH - PAD.right}\\n                y2={chartData.whoLineY}\\n                stroke=\\\"#2D6A4F\\\"\\n                strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\"\\n                strokeDasharray=\\\"4 4\\\"\\n                opacity=\\\"0.7\\\"\\n              />\\n              <text\\n                x={SVG_WIDTH - PAD.right - 4}\\n                y={chartData.whoLineY - 4}\\n                textAnchor=\\\"end\\\"\\n                className=\\\"fill-[#2D6A4F] font-mono text-[10px]\\\"\\n              >\\n                WHO 24h PM2.5 limit (15 \302\265g/m\302\263)\\n              </text>\\n            </g>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Day separator (Today | Tomorrow) */}\\n          {dayBoundaryIndex > 0 && (\\n            <g>\\n              <line\\n                x1={xPos(dayBoundaryIndex)}\\n                y1={PAD.top}\\n                x2={xPos(dayBoundaryIndex)}\\n                y2={PAD.top + PLOT_H}\\n                stroke=\\\"#D7D1C5\\\"\\n                strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\"\\n                strokeDasharray=\\\"3 3\\\"\\n              />\\n              <text\\n                x={xPos(dayBoundaryIndex) + 6}\\n                y={PAD.top + 11}\\n                className=\\\"fill-[#847F75] font-mono text-[10px]\\\"\\n              >\\n                Tomorrow\\n              </text>\\n            </g>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Data Series */}\\n          {chartData.series.map((s) => (\\n            <path\\n              key={s.id}\\n              d={s.path}\\n              fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n              stroke={s.color}\\n              strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\"\\n              strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n              strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n              strokeDasharray={s.dashed ? \'5 3\' : undefined}\\n            />\\n          ))}\\n\\n          {/* Snapped Crosshair & Data Vertices */}\\n          {selected && (\\n            <g>\\n              <line\\n                x1={xPos(safeIndex)}\\n                y1={PAD.top}\\n                x2={xPos(safeIndex)}\\n                y2={PAD.top + PLOT_H}\\n                stroke=\\\"#181715\\\"\\n                strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\"\\n                opacity=\\\"0.35\\\"\\n              />\\n              {chartData.series.map((s) => {\\n                const pt = s.points[safeIndex];\\n                if (!pt) return null;\\n                return (\\n                  <circle\\n                    key={s.id}\\n                    cx={pt.x}\\n                    cy={pt.y}\\n                    r=\\\"3.5\\\"\\n                    fill=\\\"#FFFFFF\\\"\\n                    stroke={s.color}\\n                    strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\"\\n                  />\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </g>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* X-axis ticks every 6 hours */}\\n          {hourly.map((pt, idx) => {\\n            if (idx % 6 !== 0 && idx !== hourly.length - 1) return null;\\n            return (\\n              <text\\n                key={pt.time}\\n                x={xPos(idx)}\\n                y={SVG_HEIGHT - 10}\\n                textAnchor=\\\"middle\\\"\\n                className=\\\"fill-[#847F75] font-mono text-[10px]\\\"\\n              >\\n                {pt.hourLabel}\\n              </text>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Implement precision custom SVG 48-hour forecast chart with segmented metric views, WHO reference line, and interactive crosshair readout\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/ForecastChart.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing ForecastChart SVG component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Write ForecastChart component\"}"
