    response: "Both the Kolkata live-location data bug and the slow briefing generation have been fixed:\n\n### What Was Fixed\n- **Live Location & Reverse Geocoding Accuracy**:\n  - Clicking **Use my location** now requests a fresh high-accuracy position (`maximumAge: 0`) and reverse-geocodes your coordinates on the server so it resolves to your actual city name (e.g., **Kolkata, West Bengal, India**) instead of a generic label.\n  - Added strict `AbortController` and request-sequence guards across air-data and briefing fetches, and cleared prior city state immediately upon switching locations so in-flight **New Delhi** responses can never overwrite **Kolkata** (or any selected city).\n  - Added **Kolkata** to the quick-select city list and enabled pressing **Enter** in the city search box to switch cities immediately.\n- **Faster Generation of Today\'s Briefing Summary & Tailored Actions**:\n  - Switched structured briefing generation to `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` with `ThinkingLevel.MINIMAL` (removing the multi-second thinking delay) and split generation into parallel endpoints: **Today\'s Briefing Summary** (plus alert & activity notes) populates independently while **Tailored Daily Routines, Indoor Air Hacks & Alternatives** generate concurrently in two balanced parallel batches.\n  - Added short-term server-side caching by location, AQI band, and household profile so revisiting a city or adjusting views responds immediately while still supporting fresh regeneration via **Regenerate**."
    message_id: "-r8Ba9uzGqiB_PUP4M-hgAs"
    modified_response: "Both the Kolkata live-location data bug and the slow briefing generation have been fixed:\n\n### What Was Fixed\n- **Live Location & Reverse Geocoding Accuracy**:\n  - Clicking **Use my location** now requests a fresh high-accuracy position (`maximumAge: 0`) and reverse-geocodes your coordinates on the server so it resolves to your actual city name (e.g., **Kolkata, West Bengal, India**) instead of a generic label.\n  - Added strict `AbortController` and request-sequence guards across air-data and briefing fetches, and cleared prior city state immediately upon switching locations so in-flight **New Delhi** responses can never overwrite **Kolkata** (or any selected city).\n  - Added **Kolkata** to the quick-select city list and enabled pressing **Enter** in the city search box to switch cities immediately.\n- **Faster Generation of Today\'s Briefing Summary & Tailored Actions**:\n  - Switched structured briefing generation to `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` with `ThinkingLevel.MINIMAL` (removing the multi-second thinking delay) and split generation into parallel endpoints: **Today\'s Briefing Summary** (plus alert & activity notes) populates independently while **Tailored Daily Routines, Indoor Air Hacks & Alternatives** generate concurrently in two balanced parallel batches.\n  - Added short-term server-side caching by location, AQI band, and household profile so revisiting a city or adjusting views responds immediately while still supporting fresh regeneration via **Regenerate**."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\311\002\n\306\002\001i\024}\023>\276Yl\257\033L\277N\r\201\263\177\302$,\334\273\306\320z\304f\340\261;\034/\3436hoEH\375\0255{\002\275v\330\034\337o\352\220_~Wv\240\255@\345\033\313>\001Q\270Q\213\255\373\233\255\273\270\vy\337\325\3047\240\033\307\242\2724S\330$\276\217\250\361\353Dgl\305\265A\264\246\r\003\364\035zK`1Y\216KI\212&\213\220il\251\217?\030\244)E\364\220\354\331\360\363dM\v?B\031i=\214\304$\357T`\314\274\327e1\260\206\226\263\v\270bE\3175\fC\024\205\214\310p\005XC\2278]\373\266\023\214\260\335\207\260q,{\363D\210\v\306\266\000\212\037\347[\031\215\304\371\221\3110\234O\212\234Q\205\217_-\330F\274\356\335P6\264\222\032\224\227_;A1\2409\205\206\355\205Er\217\324%\272VR\277O\200\3366\037\260:\3412zx\035\262\003;\252:\267\\\243\257U9\004\n\357d]6\254\300@\303\301\221\016\206\356}\267\205\224\304d\006\311\251\030\000\017\2367\272G\372\232\253\376\277\376\003\205\331\376\376\323\036\245\033\336^m\261t\v\354*~Q\346T{"
